  "aboutPrivacy": "Privacy",
  "aboutPrivacyBody": "This app does not collect, store or transmit any personal data. Your files are converted entirely on your device and removed from temporary storage when you finish or pick another file.\n\nThe app has no account, no advertising, no analytics, no cookies and no tracking, and it does not need an internet connection. Files are only read from the locations you choose, and results are saved or shared only when you ask.\n\nBecause no data is processed by the publisher, no consent banner is needed.",
  "aboutAccessibility": "Accessibility",
  "aboutAccessibilityBody": "The app is designed to be usable by everyone: screen reader support (VoiceOver and TalkBack), text that follows your system text size, light and dark themes with sufficient contrast, large touch targets and no time limits.\n\nThe target is level AA of WCAG 2.1, the basis of the French RGAA. A formal third-party audit has not been carried out yet, so compliance is not yet certified; this statement will be updated after the audit.\n\nIf you meet an accessibility problem, please write to {contact}. We will reply within a reasonable time and look for an alternative way to give you access to the feature.",
