  "aboutLegalBody": "Publisher: {publisher}, private individual acting in a non-professional capacity.\nContact: {contact}.\nWebsite host: OVH SAS, 2 rue Kellermann, 59100 Roubaix, France. As permitted by Article 6, III-2 of the French LCEN, the publisher has given the host their full contact details.\n\nThe app is provided free of charge and “as is”, without any purchase, subscription or advertising. Conversion results depend on the source file and may differ from the original (layout, quality, metadata); keep a copy of your originals.\n\nYou are responsible for holding the rights to the files you convert and for using the results lawfully. The app does not remove copy protection: an encrypted PDF can only be opened with the password you provide.",
